{
  "trailingSlash": true,
  "cleanUrls": false,
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/sitemap.xml",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Content-Type",
          "value": "application/xml"
        },
        {
          "key": "X-Content-Type-Options",
          "value": "nosniff"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/robots.txt",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Content-Type",
          "value": "text/plain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/kb/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Content-Type",
          "value": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

The key change is `"trailingSlash": true` — this tells Vercel to serve `/kb/` directly instead of redirecting to `/kb`.

